{
  "version": 4,
  "about": "Topics for tracking progress toward advanced AI. Each topic lists match terms (case-insensitive, whole-word unless a term ends in *). An item gets a topic when its title or summary matches at least one term; the matched terms are stored so every tag can explain itself. Version 2 adds superintelligence signals, finer capability areas, a benchmark registry (lib/analysis.js reads the reported score next to a benchmark name) and a watchlist of people whose names are matched in titles, summaries and author lists. Version 3 follows the shared spec (specs/001-superintelligence-homepage): the top level is exactly its seven superintelligence topics, finer topics are children, and 'scope' decides which stories make the superintelligence-only feed (REQ-003).",
